  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed single storey rear and side extension, by virtue of its excessive size and scale, and inappropriate position and design, would fail to appear proportionate or subordinate to the host building. Instead, it would appear a bulky and incongruous addition that would harm the character and appearance of the host property and the surrounding area. The proposal is, therefore, contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture) and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations); Part A5 of the Hounslow Character, Sustainability and Design Codes SPD, and the principles of the National Planning Policy Framework."
